## shinyExampleData

shinyExampleData is a well compressed data ready for importing in the R shiny application. 

The parameter for specifying the range of the data are  

Top = 3; Bottom = 18； Left = 2; Right = 999  

Separator Character is: [;	]


Negative control wells: DMSO and PBS

Positive wells: can be any drug names.


## shinyCombineExampleData

shinyCombineExampleData is the example data for two-drug combination screening. 

The parameter for specifying the range of the data are  

Top = 7; Bottom = 22 Left = 2; Right = 999  

Separator Character is: ,


Negative control wells: DMSO_DMSO

Positive wells: can be any drug names.